<h3>About Open Textbook Collaborative: Career and Technical Education</h3>

<p>The Open Textbook Collaborative is a project to create a community college-led, statewide collaborative in New Jersey to fill an important need for open textbooks and other learning resources.</p>

<p>OER developed for the OTC was funded by the <a href="https://www2.ed.gov/about/offices/list/ope/fipse/index.html">Fund for the Improvement of Postsecondary Education</a> (FIPSE) of the U.S. Department of Education for the Open Textbooks Pilot grant. The grant was awarded to Middlesex College for the Open Textbook Collaborative runs through 2023.</p>

<p>For more information, visit our <a href="https://middlesexcc.libguides.com/OTCProject/home" target="_blank">Open Textbook Collaborative guide</a>.</p>

<p>Current projects include:</p>

<ul>
	<li><a href="http://opennj.net/python">Introduction to Computer Programming with Python</a></li>
	<li>Analytical Geometry and Calculus 1</li>
	<li>General Physics 1 - Kotowich</li>
	<li>General Physics 1 - Tabanli</li>
	<li>Human Anatomy and Physiology 1</li>
	<li>OER ABC&#39;s</li>
	<li>Principles of Economics 1</li>
</ul>

